  * Provider-blind storage schema (#366, WS1-a; design/encryption/01 §4.1,
    §4.6): migration 122 adds `vault.uid` and `files.object_uid` (UUID columns
    of 16 raw libsodium bytes, unique, immutable once set by trigger),
