  * `Vault::upsertVault` draws a vault's uid and resolves its layout from
    `encrypt_upstream` (a request never sets it); `opaque_v1` is refused
    outside test mode until the restore drill (#371), and turning encryption
    off on an `opaque_v1` vault is refused. `File::upsertFile` keeps a
